1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Previously on Zombieland Saga Revenge, we were set to open for Iron Frill,

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
but while we focused on making a big impact,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Shiori, the leader of Iron Frill, threw us all for a loop by trying to recruit Ai to join her group!

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
No way, sister! Ai is staying with us, and that's all there is to it!

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
We totally nailed our performance, and then Shiori had the nerve to declare us rivals on live TV!

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
If that's how she wants to play it, then we're game for revenge!

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Let's go, go, go!

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Hello! Good morning, everyone!

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Uh, and a good morning to you, Lily!

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
I'm happy to see all your smiling faces!

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Although, one of you looks a little bit on the frowny side today!

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Me? This is just the way my face was...

13
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Speak up, Kotaro! And remember to enunciate!

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Enunciate? What is her deal?

15
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Yeah, what's up, Lily?

16
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Here's the sitch. I want to shine bright! Time for me to step up my game!

17
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
We're already hosting a radio show, the Saga Arena concert was a hit,

18
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
and Iron Frill declared us to be their rivals!

19
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
You've all been working hard to take revenge, which is awesome!

20
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
But I want to show up those girls, too!

21
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
I thought if I did something extra amazing to showcase my magicalness,

22
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,000
it would take Franjushu to the next level!

23
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
For a tiny little thing, you've got plenty of moxie.

24
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
So that's it. I've noticed that Lily has had something pressing on her mind lately.

25
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
She's been plotting.

26
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
You've got my full support!

27
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Do you have something fun planned?

28
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
You know it! Check this out!

29
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,000
For the first time ever, Franjushu is gonna move away from the local Saga TV spotlight

30
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
onto a national television network program!

31
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Wait! National TV?!

32
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Yeah! This is what I'm talking about!

33
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,000
I'll be entering as a contestant on Japan's Got Performance!

34
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
It's a freestyle-type audition show where anything goes!

35
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
First competitors from all over the country compete in the regional preliminaries!

36
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,000
If you win there, then you get to enter the national finals held in Tokyo!

37
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Franjushu will finally have a chance to make our big national debut on television!

38
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Yay!

39
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Lily is an expert when it comes to this sort of stuff.

40
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Yeah! You're gonna win that thing for sure!

41
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,000
I'm crazy stoked!

42
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
So when does the show start filming?

43
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
It's starting right now!

44
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Yay!

45
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Yay!

46
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Yay!

